      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">One landfill in the whole Barwon region is licensed to receive asbestos waste, and it wants a phone call before you turn up. Here is where it can legally go, how it has to be wrapped and labelled, and how asbestos bins are priced.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
